tp://classic-web.archive.org/web/20080618220010/http://radiolist.org/index.php?s=john+deneuve\" rel=\"nofollow\">‘sound cuisine’</a> for Radiolist.org, plays in duet <a href=\"http://classic-web.archive.org/web/20080618220010/http://www.vulviniaetjambonstar.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vulvinia and Jambonstar</a> and hosts a weekly radio show on Radio Grenouille: <a href=\"http://classic-web.archive.org/web/20080618220010/http://www.grenouille888.org/dyn/rubrique.php3?id_rubrique=323\" rel=\"nofollow\">Educational programme for Youth.</a></p>\n<p>Artist’s website: <a href=\"http://classic-web.archive.org/web/20080618220010/http://www.johndeneuve.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">johndeneuve.com</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/","radiaseason":"14","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.3","subject":"radio art;Radia;Radio Grenouille","title":"Show 0136: This program can by John Deneuve (Radio Grenouille)","publicdate":"2017-04-28 05:35:22","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","addeddate":"2017-04-28 05:35:22","creator":"Radio Grenouille","date":"2007-11-05","backup_location":"ia906403_3","external_metadata_update":"2019-04-09T14:39:18Z"},"server":"ia801505.us.archive.org","uniq":584844617,"workable_servers":["ia801505.us.archive.org","ia601505.us.archive.org"]}